{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的罪"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華說：",{"text":"「你們在耶路撒冷街頭四處看看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在廣場找找，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你們能找到一個公正誠實的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就赦免這城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然他們憑永活的耶和華起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻口是心非。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你關注的不是誠實嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你責打他們，他們不感到疼痛；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你嚴懲他們，他們仍不受教。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們拒不悔改，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"臉比石頭還硬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"我想：「他們貧窮、愚昧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不明白耶和華的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不知道他們上帝的法令。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要找他們的首領說話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為這些首領明白耶和華的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"知道他們上帝的法令。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，他們卻一致折斷軛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掙開繩索。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，林中的獅子必襲擊他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荒野的豺狼必殘害他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豹子也蹲伏在他們的城外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伺機撕裂出城的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們罪大惡極，屢屢叛道。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「耶路撒冷啊，我怎能赦免你呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的兒女背棄我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憑假神起誓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我供應他們的一切需要，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻縱情淫亂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"湧向娼妓的家。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們像吃得肥壯、發情的公馬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"個個垂涎鄰居的妻子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能不懲罰他們呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能不親自報應這樣的國民呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要上去毀壞她的葡萄園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但不可徹底毀壞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要砍掉枝子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為那些枝子不屬於耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家和猶大家全然背叛我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"「他們毀謗耶和華說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『祂不會管的，災禍不會臨到我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們必不會遇見刀劍和饑荒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知不過是一陣風，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的話並非來自上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們預言的災禍必降臨到自己身上。』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"因此，萬軍之上帝耶和華對我說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「因為他們說了這話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我的話在你口中成為火，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們像柴一樣被燒毀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家啊，我要使一個國家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一個歷久不衰的古國從遠方來攻擊你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不明白他們的語言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也聽不懂他們說的話。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都是勇士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的箭袋像敞開的墳墓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必吞噬你們的莊稼和糧食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞噬你們的兒女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞噬你們的牛羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞噬你們的葡萄和無花果，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用刀劍摧毀你們所依靠的堅城。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶和華說：「即使在那時，我也不會徹底毀滅你們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["耶利米啊，如果有人問，『為什麼我們的上帝耶和華這樣待我們？』你可以對他們說，『你們怎樣背棄耶和華，在自己的土地上供奉外族的神明，也要怎樣在異地他鄉服侍外族人。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"「要向雅各家宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在猶大傳講，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『聽著，你們這群愚昧無知的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們視而不見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽而不聞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道你們不該敬畏我嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道你們在我面前不該顫抖嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我以沙石為海的界限，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使水永遠不能越過它。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"洶湧的波濤不能逾越，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"澎湃的海浪不能漫過。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你們這些人心裡頑固，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"悖逆成性。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們離我而去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們心中從不說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們要敬畏我們的上帝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂按時降下秋雨和春雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓我們按時收割。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的罪過使你們不再風調雨順，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的罪惡使你們失去祝福。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民中有惡人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們像捕鳥人一樣埋伏等候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"設下網羅陷害人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的家裡充滿了詭詐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像籠子裝滿了鳥。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們變得有財有勢，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃得肥胖紅潤，壞事做盡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不秉公審判，不為孤兒伸冤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不為窮人主持公道。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「我怎能坐視不理呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能不懲罰這樣的國家呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這地方發生了一件令人震驚、恐懼的事，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是先知說假預言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司濫用權力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民卻以此為樂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但當最後的結局來臨時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們還能做什麼呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}